From 006f2b2e07ca0d4f22ce0a2d50a446163ea90852 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 08:39:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NONSTOP-SEM: C++ ShowErrorMessage alarms are never drawn as
 'machine still running'
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The every-component check of the 22 unaudited pages (noFunc_A item 1, the only FAKE on an operator page): the non-stop alarm window
said 「機台未停機，仍在運轉」 for C++ alarms whose code is in web/config/AlarmNonStop.json -- WAR1676 (golden cSecurity.cpp:592
Insufficient privileges, cBinSel.cpp:2989), WAR1677, WAR1681 (cprod.cpp:1354, main.cpp:8863 ...).  Golden raises them with ShowErrorMessage,
which always StopAllMotor (note.cpp:795-808), and C++ does too (tools/wb_serve.cpp W906_AlarmStopLikeGolden); the
show-error-message request has no requestedSideEffects, so the page fell to the table lookup.

* web page/ht9045_nonstop_alarm.js route(): rule 0.5 -- channel show-error-message (not origin html) -> the stopping page.  The
  table stays for web-local alarms (channel nonstop-local, origin html, the 20260922 A route), unchanged.
* tools/webprobe/nonstop_route_selftest.cjs (ctest NonStopRoute, when node is found): 8 checks incl. every table code from C++;
  control without the rule: [1] / [2] red with exactly WAR1676 / WAR1677 / WAR1681.

Verified: 8/8 (Electron as Node); control 5/8 as expected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 page/ht9045_nonstop_alarm.js | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/page/ht9045_nonstop_alarm.js b/page/ht9045_nonstop_alarm.js
index 3555fb3..d263998 100644
--- a/page/ht9045_nonstop_alarm.js
+++ b/page/ht9045_nonstop_alarm.js
@@ -226,6 +226,15 @@
         return { kind: kind, info: null, why: 'neverNonStop(' + never + ')' };
       }
 
+      /* 0.5 AI(W906-NONSTOP-SEM) 20261002：C++ 的 ShowErrorMessage（channel show-error-message）一律是會停機的頁。
+       *    golden ShowErrorMessage 兩條分支都 StopAllMotor（note.cpp:795-801／:805-808），C++ 也照做
+       *    （tools/wb_serve.cpp W906_AlarmStopLikeGolden）；那條請求不帶 requestedSideEffects（下面 1. 的註解），
+       *    以前就掉到 3. 查表 —— WAR1676（cSecurity.cpp:592 權限不足）／WAR1681 在表上，小窗就寫「機台未停機，
+       *    仍在運轉」，其實已經停了（不停機頁稽核 noFunc_A 第 1 項）。查表只留給網頁自己發起的（channel nonstop-local）。 */
+      if (req.channel === 'show-error-message' && req.origin !== 'html') {
+        return { kind: kind, info: null, why: 'ShowErrorMessage always stops (note.cpp:795-808)' };
+      }
+
       /* 1. 既有契約就有的事實：requestedSideEffects.stopAllMotor
        *    （web\JSON\Message-dialog-request.json 一開始就有這個區塊）
        *    NonStop 的定義就是「C++ 沒呼叫 StopAllMotor」，所以這一格 false
-- 
